  "body": "See w3c/html-aam#55. There was some browser-developer confusion on whether `<img alt>` is same as `<img alt=''>` are equivalent versus distinguishable. The answer is that they are equivalent.\r\n\r\nIt may be worth clarifying this in the HTML Standard itself to prevent future similar confusion.",
